{"id":6322,"chapter_id":6,"scene_id":611,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"それは突然無数の黒い汚泥となってゾーヤの首を絞めた。","style":3,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"混沌の声色","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44>残れ！！</size></color>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"ゾーヤ","content":"きさまは一体何者だ！","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"黒い汚泥が凝縮し、一人の人間の姿を形作った。それはゾーヤ自身だった。","style":3,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"ゾーヤ？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>お前の戦い、力、渇望……その全てが俺だ……</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"ゾーヤ？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>魂の奥底で繋がっているのがこの俺だ……</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"ゾーヤ","content":"きさまは……？","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"若いゾーヤ？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>俺はお前だ。お前から生まれた、お前の願いそのものだ。</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222008"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"若いゾーヤ？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>お前は破壊のために生まれた。</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"幼いゾーヤ？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>お前は……ここにいるべきだ！</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"ゾーヤ","content":"黙れ！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"彼女の背後に赤い幻月が昇る。それは巨大な眼球で、その緋色の凝視が、彼女の魂の底を、過去、憎しみ、そして渇望を、全てしっかりと見据えていた。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"彼女の手に付いた血が、彼女の犯した罪を教えている。彼女は全てを理解した。力、ブラックリング、根源……これは彼女によって生み出された深淵なのだ。この敵にはかなわない。なぜならそれは……彼女自身なのだから。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"混沌の声色","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>そうだ……戦え、ゾーヤ……永遠に戦い、永遠に破壊するのだ……</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"ゾーヤ","content":"永遠に破壊する……","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"ゾーヤ","content":"これが……俺の戦いなのか？","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"彼女の耳に聞き慣れた轟音がかすかに届いた。絶えることのない爆発は小さな火球を形作り、赤い月へと近づき、そしてゆっくりと呑み込まれていく。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}